<title>HONG KONG: Companion Marble interim net up 31 pct.</title>
<headline>Companion Marble interim net up 31 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   7.52   vs 6.15</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.0    vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    32.24  vs 24.60</p>
<p>    Turnover		     302.99 vs 238.69</p>
<p>    Company name		 Companion Marble (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  March 4-7</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   March 13</p>
<p>NOTE - Marble and granite products distributor Companion Marble, a spinoff of construction materials concern Companion Building Material (Holdings) Ltd, was listed on the Stock Exchange on April 25, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
